  "description": "PAT-injected git wrapper for Azure DevOps. Wraps `git -c http.extraHeader=AUTHORIZATION: Basic <pat-base64>` so every fetch / push / clone against ADO authenticates with a Secret-typed PAT, bypassing Git Credential Manager identity confusion on multi-tenant machines. Eliminates the most-repeated boilerplate in ADO-targeted Tamp build scripts.",
